      "title": "REFERENCE CONTROLS",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Start\nEdit SCENE and keep the seed fixed. Run.\n\n**Influence** controls the total reference effect. **Weight** controls each reference’s strength (0.05 = 5%, 1 = full before Influence). Strengths add without normalization. Disable B to test A alone.\n\n**Context** reduces copied layouts by keeping image-informed text states. **Full** also supplies visual tokens for stronger resemblance. Neither guarantees identity or grid removal.\n\nAdd another FL Krea Reference and connect it to the next growing socket.\n\nTwo references usually take three model evaluations per sampling evaluation.\n\nAdvanced: start/end use full diffusion progress; fade softens their edges."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Start\nEdit SCENE and keep the seed fixed. Run.\n\n**Influence** controls the total reference effect. **Weight** controls each reference’s share. Disable B to test A alone.\n\n**Context** reduces copied layouts by keeping image-informed text states. **Full** also supplies visual tokens for stronger resemblance. Neither guarantees identity or grid removal.\n\nAdd another FL Krea Reference and connect it to the next growing socket.\n\nTwo references usually take three model evaluations per sampling evaluation.\n\nAdvanced: start/end use full diffusion progress; fade softens their edges."
      },
      "color": "#233b40",
      "bgcolor": "#304e54"
    }
